  "notes": "Source table on page 53 provides withdrawal rates by years of service only, separated by Police and Fire. The target requires a single rate grid. Since the document does not provide a headcount distribution to weight Police and Fire rates, and the target implies a single plan rate, the Police column is used as the primary source (series_op: copy) and broadcast across all target ages. The source rates are in percent and will be converted to decimal by the code. Target service bins 1-10 map directly to single-year source rows. Target bins 11 and 12 map to the '11-14' source bin. Target bins 30 and 40 map to the '25 & over' source bin. The broadcast axis is 'age' because the source rates vary only by service.",
